#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:6
msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:8
msgid "`nix store verify` - verify the integrity of store paths"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:10
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:12
msgid "`nix store verify` \\[_option_...\\] _installables_..."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:14
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:16
msgid "Verify the entire Nix store:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:22
msgid ""
"Check whether each path in the closure of Firefox has at least 2 signatures:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:29
msgid "Verify a store path in the binary cache `https://cache.nixos.org/`:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:31
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix store verify --store https://cache.nixos.org/ \\\n"
"    /nix/store/10l19qifk7hjjq47px8m2prqk1gv4isy-hello-2.10\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:36
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:38
msgid ""
"This command verifies the integrity of the store paths [_installables_](./"
"nix.md#installables), or, if `--all` is given, the entire Nix store. For "
"each path, it checks that"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:42
msgid "its contents match the NAR hash recorded in the Nix database; and"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:44
msgid ""
"it is _trusted_, that is, it is signed by at least one trusted signing key, "
"is content-addressed, or is built locally (\"ultimately trusted\")."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:48
msgid "Exit status"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:50
msgid "The exit status of this command is the sum of the following values:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:52
msgid ""
"**1** if any path is corrupted (i.e. its contents don't match the recorded "
"NAR hash)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:55
msgid "**2** if any path is untrusted."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-verify.md:57
msgid ""
"**4** if any path couldn't be verified for any other reason (such as an I/O "
"error)."
msgstr ""

